/**
 * Spine Event Contract - ADR-007
 *
 * Runtime Tier Boundaries and Export Spine Contract
 *
 * This module defines the spine event contract for Tier 2 → Tier 3 communication.
 * All events transmitted from the local daemon to the API must validate against
 * these schemas and include the required envelope fields.
 *
 * ## Architecture
 *
 * ```
 * Tier 1 (Surfaces)    Tier 2 (Daemon)    Tier 3 (API)
 *  inspectable    ──▶   local-only   ──▶   server-only
 *  distribution         intelligence       intelligence
 *
 *                       Internal Bus
 *                           │
 *                       Projector  ◀── single choke point
 *                           │
 *                       Spine Contract
 *                           │
 *                           ▼
 *                     Tier 3 Ingest
 * ```
 *
 * ## Normative Invariants (ADR-007 §2)
 *
 * ### MUST
 * - **M5**: Every spine event carries the required envelope (§3.1)
 * - **M6**: TypeScript types generated from Zod schemas
 * - **M7**: Identifiers hashed before transmission
 * - **M9**: Breaking changes require new schemaVersion
 *
 * ### MUST NOT
 * - **N3**: Daemon must not transmit raw file paths
 * - **N6**: Internal bus shape must not be external contract
 *
 * ### SHOULD
 * - **S1**: Session-bound events should include sessionId
 * - **S2**: Projector should batch spine events
 *
 * @module @vreko/contracts/events/spine
 * @see ADR-007 Runtime Tier Boundaries and Export Spine Contract
 */
